Maintainer: Vanilla Hsu <v@embark.systems>
# cargo is not listed: the program needs a Rust newer than the distributions ship (the
# Dockerfile builds with 1.99), so it comes from rustup or the rust image. See packages/README.md.
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, g++, make, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/embark-systems/rradius
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: rradius
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Recommends: ca-certificates
Description: RADIUS and TACACS+ server with Luau scripts and a built-in cluster database
 rradius answers RADIUS and TACACS+ requests. Authentication and accounting logic is
 written in Luau scripts and SQL; the data lives in an embedded hiqlite cluster, so a
 cluster needs no external database.
 .
 The package installs the program, the RADIUS dictionaries and the documentation. It does
 not create a configuration or start the service; see /usr/share/doc/rradius/README.packages.
